LLM_RULES.md

# Ephemeral agent loop state (kol-goal).
# Glob, not the bare name: goal files are per-session as of 2026-08-15
# (.active-goal-<session_id>.md), so an exact-name rule would leave every
# new one untracked-but-visible. .gitignore has no trailing comments —
# a `#` only starts one at the beginning of a line.
.kol/llm-context/.active-goal*.md
_tmp/
